---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Big-O Complexity Calculator" description="Our privacy policy and how we handle your data.">
  <main class="container">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: June 4, 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>Big-O Complexity Calculator ("we," "us," "our," or "Company") operates the www.bigocalculator.com website (the "Site"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and otherwise handle your information when you visit our website.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Code snippets submitted for analysis</li>
          <li>Contact form information (name, email, message)</li>
          <li>Usage analytics (anonymized)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To provide and improve our analysis service</li>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries</li>
          <li>To analyze usage patterns and enhance user experience</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Google AdSense & Advertising</h2>
        <p>This website uses Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google may use cookies and other tracking technologies to collect information about your browsing activity. You can control personalized ads by visiting Google's Ads Settings.</p>
        <p>Third-party advertisers may also display ads on this site. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access your personal data</li>
          <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Opt-out of marketing communications</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at: privacy@bigocalculator.com</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <style>
    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .content-wrapper {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      border: 1px solid #16213e;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: #ddd;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #00d4ff;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .last-updated {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #00d4ff;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    ul {
      margin-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>